        <span itemprop="definition">vary in physical properties, and it is impossible to achieve the specific ratio d ave /d max of this invention by using the fillers arbitrarily. However, it is possible to improve the battery property by controlling the physical properties.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0161">
