      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">Example 4</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">it is revealed from comparison between Examples 1 to 3 and Example 4 that it is possible to further improve the cyclability at high temperatures by controlling the contents of specific impurities, namely of halogen element, particularly of chlorine elements and iron elements.</span>
