      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the obtained whole cloth sheet</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was drawn at 70° C. in the sheet&#39;s longitudinal direction (MD) by 1.31 times and then at 110° C. in the sheet&#39;s width direction (TD) by 2.95 times to obtain a polymer porous film having a film thickness of 25  ⁇ m, a porosity of 60%, and a Gurley air permeability of 110 second/100 cc.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0163">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
